 colspan=\"3\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"154\" style=\"width: 154px\"><h3 id=\"s-8x84pf97\">客户端（SDK）</h3></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"154\" style=\"width: 154px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>错误码</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"463\" style=\"width: 463px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>描述</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"689\" style=\"width: 689px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>解决方法</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"154\" style=\"width: 154px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>0</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"463\" style=\"width: 463px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>接口请求成功</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"689\" style=\"width: 689px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>不涉及</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"154\" style=\"width: 154px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>1</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"463\" style=\"width: 463px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>已经订阅成功，再次发起订阅请求会返回1</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"689\" style=\"width: 689px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>不涉及</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"154\" style=\"width: 154px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>101</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"463\" style=\"width: 463px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>系统不支持push功能</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"689\" style=\"width: 689px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支持的设备参考：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/156#s-6ihc25pc\">常见FAQ-&gt;九、vivo推送支持的版本</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"154\" style=\"width: 154px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>102</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"463\" style=\"width: 463px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>push初始化时传入的context对象为空</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\